"Search for `1-Wire libraries <https://platformio.org/lib/search?query=%25221-"
"wire%2522>`_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/lib/cmd_search.rst:215
msgid ""
"Search for `Arduino-based \"I2C\" libraries <https://platformio.org/lib/"
"search?query=framework%253Aarduino%2520i2c>`_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/lib/cmd_search.rst:256
msgid ""
"Search for `libraries by \"web\" and \"http\" keywords <https://platformio."
"org/lib/search?"
"query=keyword%253A%2522web%2522%2520keyword%253A%2522http%2522>`_."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/lib/cmd_search.rst:307
msgid ""
"Search for `libraries by \"Adafruit Industries\" author <https://platformio."
"org/lib/search?query=author%253A%2522Adafruit%20Industries%2522>`_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/lib/cmd_search.rst:338
msgid ""
"Search for `libraries which are compatible with Dallas temperature sensors "
"<https://platformio.org/lib/search?query=DS*>`_ like DS18B20, DS18S20 and "
"etc."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/lib/cmd_search.rst:370
msgid ""
"Search for `Energia-based *nRF24* or *HttpClient* libraries <https://"
"platformio.org/lib/search?"
"query=framework%253Aenergia%2520%252B(nRF24%2520HttpClient)>`_. The search "
"query that is described below can be interpreted like ``energia nRF24 OR "
"energia HttpClient``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/lib/cmd_search.rst:414
msgid ""
"Search for the `all sensor libraries excluding temperature <https://"
"platformio.org/lib/search?query=sensor%2520-temperature>`_."
msgstr ""
